 e Ste C\, Santa Rosa\, CA\n👥 **Ages:** 16+\n\nJoin us for a hands-on cl
 ay workshop at **Full Circle Studio 360!** In this one-day event\, you'll 
 make your Mini Chicken and glaze in 1 day.\n\nThis is a great opportunity 
 to explore your creativity\, meet fellow art lovers\, and take home a uniq
 ue handmade piece! No prior experience needed.\n\n🎟️ **Limited spots 
