SUMMARY:Wise Woman Sanctuary\, Personal Exploration Through Expressive Pai
 nting
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n**Wise Woman Sanctuary\, P
 ersonal Exploration Through Image**\n\nStep into a transformative space wh
 ere **self-exploration\, art therapy**\, and mindfulness come together to 
 nurture your inner wisdom. At **Wise Women Sanctuary**\, we invite you to 
 engage in **Personal Exploration Through Image**\, using creativity as a p
 athway to connect with your inner self.\n\nThis **Creative Expression Work
 shop** blends **painting\, meditation**\, and holistic wellness practices 
 to deepen your **self-awareness** and inspire **self-empowerment**. Guided
  by Christi Corradi\, a seasoned mentor in **manifestation** and the **Uni
 versal Principles**\, you’ll uncover new tools for personal growth and g
 ain profound insights into your journey.\nThrough the magic of **mixed med
 ia art**\, you’ll explore how imagery can reveal answers within\, sparki
 ng creativity and fostering a deeper understanding of your unique path.\n\
 n**Details:**\n✨ **Location**: Wise Women Sanctuary\n✨ **Schedule**: G
 roups meet on the first and third Wednesday mornings\n✨ **Duration**: 3 
 hours\n✨ **Cost**: First session free\; $50 per session\n\nWhether you
 ’re a beginner or an experienced artist\, this workshop invites you to l
 et your imagination soar and create meaningful art that resonates with you
 r personal journey. Connect\, create\, and discover the transformative pow
 er of image and creativity at Wise Women Sanctuary.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/full-circle-studio/events/315833610/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260725T161829Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260725T161829Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
