SUMMARY:Beading Craft Nite
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n\\*\\*Please REGISTER ON T
 ARA'S WEBSITE TO ATTEND THIS session.\nWomen's Arts & Crafts\, 5- 7 PM\, $
 10\nBeading Projects\, 4-7 PM\, $25\nLink HERE: [https://www.taradickinson
 .com/lets-create/workshops](https://www.taradickinson.com/lets-create/work
 shops)\nThank you! \\*\\*\\*\n\nAdded to this week's Women's Arts & Crafts
  night is the option to do a beading project.\nI'll be there at 4:00 PM\, 
 so you have an extra hour to craft if you choose this option.\n\nCheck out
  this LINK on my website to see the variety of projects you can do.\n\nThe
  rafting projects I offer: a few different relaxing art projects to choose
  from:\n\n* Collage a treasure box or BOOK\n* Art journal (I picked up 3 g
 orgeous blank art journals if anyone needs one\, $7)\n* Zen Doodles\n* Abs
 tract coloring\n* Making note cards\n* Or bring your own project & hang ou
 t!\n\n**It's about connection & creation in a safe space.**\n\nAll art sup
 plies provided\, **BYOB drinks & snacks (wine welcome)\, kitchen on site.*
 *\n\nPlease message me with any questions.\n**We have room for 12!**
