SUMMARY:Moon Dreams - Mixed Media Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n**Come create your own Moo
 n Dreams!**\n\nSpend a playful afternoon exploring paint\, foil\, beads\, 
 charms and other fun embellishments as you create your own 8" × 8" mixed 
 media artwork.\n\nNo art experience is needed. Moon Dreams is a fun\, begi
 nner-friendly project with plenty of room to experiment and make it unique
 ly yours.\n\n**All materials are provided — just bring yourself and come
  ready to create.**\n\n**\\- Julia**
